 "amendments": {
  "items": {
   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the insurance law, in relation to insurers providing an\nactuarially appropriate reduction of premiums for yacht or boating liability\ninsurance",
    "basePrintNo": "S1307",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S1307-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §2336-b, Ins L (as proposed in S.3688-A & A.5415-A)",
    "lawSection": "Insurance Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S1307\n\nSPONSOR: PALUMBO\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the insurance law, in relation to insurers providing an\nactuarially appropriate reduction of premiums for yacht or boating\nliability insurance\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo make clarifying changes to chapter 355 of the laws of 2020 by remov-\ning mandatory language related to insurers providing for a premium rate\nreduction to insureds upon completion of a boating safety course.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection one of the bill would remove mandatory language related to\npremium rate reductions by insurers. An insurer may, upon submission of\na completion certificate by an insured, provide an actuarially-appropri-\nate reduction of the premium for such insured's yacht or boating liabil-\nity insurance.\n\nSection two of the bill would provide the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill would provide a potential incentive to insureds to learn and\nfollow rules and procedures for boating safety by giving owners who\ncomplete basic or advanced boating safety courses the opportunity for a\nreduction in boating liability insurance. In permissively changing the\nlanguage of the underlying legislation, this bill would allow insurers\nflexibility in providing reductions to ensure stability for insurance\nproducers and by allowing case by case evaluations of policies based on\neach insurer's assessed risk and underwriting criteria.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
